/T (The system aims to reunite missing persons with their loved ones by leveraging MTCNN face recognition to make searches faster and more accurate. It allows users to report cases, verify identities, and communicate within the platform, ensuring a collaborative approach. With additional features like multilingual support, search filters, and rewards, the system enhances transparency, efficiency, and impact in the search for missing people.)
