/Title (MTCNN Technology For Reunification With Reward Outcomes is a system that helps locate missing individuals using face recognition technology. Users can upload missing person details and photos, which are then displayed on the website for visibility. Public users can upload or scan suspected images to check for possible matches with the database. The system also offers multi-language support, search filters, messaging, community interaction, and rewards, encouraging participation. This makes the search for missing persons faster, more accurate, and collaborative.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1643 0 R
>>
